  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zeraf Sorghum Milling Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Name: Zeraf Sorghum Milling Capacity Building Project. .Location: Zeraf village..Summary: This project will enable ZMCS to purchase sorghum from farmers and improve their sorghum processing capabilities. The grant will also fund trainings in agronomy, financial management, governance, and revolving fund management.,</narrative>
